<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Input Absensi - MBG</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/dashboard.css">
</head>
<body>
    <nav class="navbar">
        <h2>Aplikasi MBG</h2>
        <span>Kembali ke <a href="/" style="color: var(--accent-color);">Dashboard</a></span>
    </nav>

    <div class="dashboard-container">
        <div class="dashboard-card">
            <h3>Input Kehadiran Siswa Hari Ini</h3>
            <p>Masukkan jumlah siswa yang hadir agar porsi makanan disesuaikan.</p>
            <br>
            
            <form action="/submit-absensi" method="POST">
                <input type="hidden" name="sekolah_id" value="1">
                <input type="hidden" name="menu_id" value="1">
                
                <div style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                    <label for="jumlah_hadir" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-weight: bold;">Jumlah Siswa Hadir:</label>
                    <input type="number" id="jumlah_hadir" name="jumlah_hadir" min="1" required 
                           style="padding: 8px; width: 100%; max-width: 300px; border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 4px;">
                </div>
                
                <button type="submit" class="btn-accent">Kirim Data Pesanan</button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>